<body>
    <h1>USAV Business Process Documentation</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h3 local-id=3D"53975cd5bfdd" id=3D"USAVBusinessProcessDocumentatio=
n-1.DocumentPurpose">1. Document Purpose</h3>
<p local-id=3D"4adf5527f609">This Business Requirements Document (BRD) spec=
ifies the high-level business needs and operational workflows of USAV Solut=
ions. It defines <em>what</em> the system must accomplish before translatin=
g these needs into technical specifications (SRS).</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"42f51614a16f" id=3D"USAVBusinessProcessDocumentation-2.Busi=
nessObjectives">2. Business Objectives</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"512693ad-0d29-4926-9477-0e3ea5cf5c9b">
<li local-id=3D"c00843de-58c3-4d56-9d4d-27fec2369e94">
<p local-id=3D"afc3ee609cea"><strong>Minimize Shipping Errors</strong>: Ach=
ieve &gt;99.9% order packing accuracy using barcode double-scan &amp; Photo=
 verification.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"64b8fbb2-9508-4c0c-8a11-85cbf58721b3">
<p local-id=3D"3dd0a7a41278"><strong>Reduce Diagnostic Bottlenecks</strong>=
: Standardize cosmetic and acoustic grading criteria for used Bose equipmen=
t.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0d897cc1-8089-4795-8045-ca9e3d6460c2">
<p local-id=3D"f16781210163"><strong>Optimize Purchasing Margins</strong>: =
Track bidding bids vs. historical sales prices to maximize ROI on liquidati=
on pallets.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1669e923-8d22-464a-93fb-62ea4e12ca0e">
<p local-id=3D"7c9b1b9eb63f"><strong>Consolidate Customer Support</strong>:=
 Access customer chats and order histories across all 5 sales channels in a=
 single screen.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"32a176d8-faf6-4d0d-a922-e01c5c2ec8bc">
<p local-id=3D"d02981c15e64"><strong>Protect Against Fraud Claims</strong>:=
 Map specific CCTV recording timestamps directly to packer logs for high-va=
lue shipping dispute resolution.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fd8c6743-36be-448a-9aa4-fea0f6f4086a">
<p local-id=3D"671593994f33"><strong>Unify Multi-Account &amp; Listing Mana=
gement</strong>: Centrally manage multiple Amazon (e.g., FBA vs. Merchant) =
and eBay accounts. Monitor Listing Health (suppressed listings, policy viol=
ations) and compare Sales Channel Performance in real-time.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"42dfc621cbb9" id=3D"USAVBusinessProcessDocumentation-3.Stak=
eholders&amp;UserRoles">3. Stakeholders &amp; User Roles</h2>
