nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1c70083ba850"><strong>Refurbishment Technician</strong></p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f9689805-6f07-46a4-84da-cdc55eb67a47" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"809419cfff46">Tests acoustic quality and cosmetic condition.=
</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fc28c995-8fd1-4282-a2e0-3d7870a5b0e2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a479a4447b15">Serial number registrar, Bose parts compatibil=
