<p local-id=3D"f741024ab80b">Packs products and prints shipping labels.</p>=
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2f5afb78-acf4-4373-9980-fdafe29e6bed" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2907a043e383">Packing scan verification screen, weight/dimen=
sion logging.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5ee71480-3957-4944-ae91-560c915f82de">
<td data-local-id=3D"dac513e4-3682-4e11-90fe-05593c30111c" class=3D"conflue=
