<td data-local-id=3D"e317f7b8-4897-4ea3-9322-f187c8ae11ee" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"90f85c71db59">Handles returns, warranty claims, and buyer ch=
ats.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"229fb813-1c3a-4e56-a268-cd46169a0e90" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9397f3a57b8f">Multi-channel chat dashboard, RMA tracker, ref=
und validator.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"fb857b35-1f07-4bff-95ad-4b941faf05aa">
<td data-local-id=3D"bcced018-377e-4cf7-91e6-393ea16aa2fb" class=3D"conflue=
