<h3 local-id=3D"712c2031e80d" id=3D"USAVBusinessProcessDocumentation-4.1War=
ehouseOperations(Inbound$\rightarrow$Diagnostics$\rightarrow$Outbound)">4.1=
 Warehouse Operations (Inbound $\rightarrow$ Diagnostics $\rightarrow$ Outb=
ound)</h3>
<h4 local-id=3D"58c71abd7809" id=3D"USAVBusinessProcessDocumentation-Inboun=
dReceiving(CLERK)">Inbound Receiving (CLERK)</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"a415a248c1df">
<li local-id=3D"2e3e7af8fce5">
<p local-id=3D"18268df319d9"><strong>Manifest Ingestion</strong>: The syste=
m must log bulk arrivals (pallets or boxes) from suppliers, liquidators, or=
 customer returns.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5a26704dd238">
<p local-id=3D"e6e892236baf"><strong>Carton Barcoding</strong>: Automatical=
ly generate and print tracking barcodes for incoming uninspected lots.</p><=
/li>
</ul>
<h4 local-id=3D"d0de1e3a5a41" id=3D"USAVBusinessProcessDocumentation-Testin=
g&amp;DiagnosticGrading(TECHNICIAN)">Testing &amp; Diagnostic Grading (TECH=
NICIAN)</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"53fcfa33004d">
<li local-id=3D"64eaeb51f16f">
<p local-id=3D"7fb2d7ec2d67"><strong>Serial Number Tracking</strong>: Every=
 used Bose item must be logged by its physical serial number (or an ERP-min=
ted Unit UID if the serial number is missing/defaced).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ca2b5b013ca5">
<p local-id=3D"fa3d82260a57"><strong>Cosmetic &amp; Functional Grading Chec=
klist</strong>: Standardize grading input (e.g., <em>Grade A: Like New</em>=
, <em>Grade B: Minor Scratches</em>, <em>Grade C: Moderate Wear</em>).</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"e9d96a37eb97">
<p local-id=3D"f1e970e48963"><strong>Acoustic Diagnostic Checklist</strong>=
: Standardize testing checklist templates for specific product classes (e.g=
., Bose Wave Music Systems must pass CD player spin, Bluetooth pair, aux-in=
, and speaker balance tests).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e04f92b2a7b3">
<p local-id=3D"a3bcdafc6f71"><strong>Parts Compatibility Engine</strong>: T=
echnicians must be able to view which salvage parts (such as replacement Bo=
se optical lasers or speaker drivers) are compatible with the model under r=
epair.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 local-id=3D"fff637030cfa" id=3D"USAVBusinessProcessDocumentation-Packin=
g&amp;Verification(PACKER)">Packing &amp; Verification (PACKER)</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"debecf2157f4">
<li local-id=3D"aacaf6bf1f9e">
<p local-id=3D"a919118e7bcd"><strong>Double-Scan Safety</strong>: Require p=
ackers to scan the invoice barcode and then scan each item's barcode before=
 completing the packaging run.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e4b603893524">
<p local-id=3D"e6b908f7a758"><strong>Scale &amp; Dimension Integration</str=
ong>: Dynamically pull weights from connected scales to verify physical con=
tents match catalog standards.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"4ed7670d115d">
<h3 local-id=3D"77f2084d8b2c" id=3D"USAVBusinessProcessDocumentation-4.2Sou=
rcing&amp;PurchasingOperations(Bidding$\rightarrow$Buying)">4.2 Sourcing &a=
mp; Purchasing Operations (Bidding $\rightarrow$ Buying)</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"4e59a46fca36">
<li local-id=3D"19b8de47d9d1">
<p local-id=3D"7563eb4da260"><strong>Auction Bid Manager</strong>: Track op=
en bids on liquidation lots (e.g., pallets of customer-returned Bose headse=
ts from liquidators).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3566df00428a">
<p local-id=3D"3fa3fd38f385"><strong>Historical Margin Calculator</strong>:=
 Before placing a bid, the system should reference historical sales data fo=
r similar condition grades to calculate estimated repair costs and potentia=
l ROI.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"091ccb5947cc">
<p local-id=3D"4892eaa26c89"><strong>Purchase Order (PO) Tracker</strong>: =
Create and track POs sent to audio equipment suppliers.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"90e6a2dfa3b3">
<h3 local-id=3D"7ba1057cd586" id=3D"USAVBusinessProcessDocumentation-4.3Cus=
tomerSupport&amp;Ticketing">4.3 Customer Support &amp; Ticketing</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"5ec6bfdab382">
<li local-id=3D"bcf779dac0ed">
<p local-id=3D"a04ebf82b12e"><strong>Unified Messaging Center</strong>: Agg=
regate customer messages, questions, and order inquiries from Amazon, eBay,=
 Shopify, Ecwid, and Walmart into a single support interface.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7bab97a6db53">
<p local-id=3D"1628fbb8ff01"><strong>RMA &amp; Return Processing</strong>: =
Map return requests directly to the original serial number of the shipped p=
roduct.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8b976f35242c">
<p local-id=3D"929f3d1328bc"><strong>Warranty Verification</strong>: Instan=
tly check if a customer's product serial number is within USAV's warranty p=
eriod (e.g., 90-day parts and labor).</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"3192028b181f">
<h3 local-id=3D"d96e30eade60" id=3D"USAVBusinessProcessDocumentation-4.4Sec=
urityOperations(CCTVMonitor)">4.4 Security Operations (CCTV Monitor)</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"7ae1b0fa75fa">
<li local-id=3D"7635b536c83e">
<p local-id=3D"deade9a97f08"><strong>Packer Camera Mapping</strong>: Link p=
hysical packing stations to specific high-definition CCTV camera feeds.</p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"9dfad623ed9e">
<p local-id=3D"8289dcf0555d"><strong>Timestamp Audit Trail</strong>: When a=
 packer completes a shipment, the ERP must stamp the exact video timestamp =
(Start and End of packing process) to the package audit log.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"00746e8a4395">
<p local-id=3D"5b6cae11c4ec"><strong>Instant Dispute Playback</strong>: If =
a customer claims "an empty box arrived" or "parts were missing," support a=
gents must be able to click a button in the order history and view the vide=
o of that specific packing run.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"18286d171947">
<h3 local-id=3D"dfe2cd6430ca" id=3D"USAVBusinessProcessDocumentation-4.5Dat=
aOperations(MasterDataManagement)">4.5 Data Operations (Master Data Managem=
ent)</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"e2f04d1f3e81">
<li local-id=3D"6263f822b38f">
<p local-id=3D"667598b2187f"><strong>SKU Normalization Mapping</strong>: Re=
solve marketplace-specific listing IDs (e.g., eBay Item ID, Amazon ASIN) to=
 the central USAV Master SKU.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"86fbb316b502">
<p local-id=3D"59d434e3b123"><strong>Real-time Inventory Sync</strong>: Whe=
n a serialized unit is marked "Sold" on one platform (e.g., eBay), the syst=
em must update inventory availability across all other platforms (Shopify, =
Ecwid, Walmart, Amazon) to prevent overselling.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"5abc8038bd35">
<h3 local-id=3D"3d4e1a0c1062" id=3D"USAVBusinessProcessDocumentation-4.6Mar=
ketingOperations(YouTubePipeline)">4.6 Marketing Operations (YouTube Pipeli=
ne)</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"9eae1c8041c7">
<li local-id=3D"25f8019fbd4a">
<p local-id=3D"26d1bb231f02"><strong>Content Pipeline Tracker</strong>: Man=
age the production schedule for YouTube video campaigns (product tutorials,=
 reviews, Bose repair guides, and demos).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"da446693307f">
<p local-id=3D"b79a6dd0140a"><strong>Media Asset Association</strong>: Link=
 YouTube video URLs and tutorial guides directly to target SKUs in the cata=
log to provide immediate help resources for customer service tickets.</p></=
li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"672d9261eeec">
<h3 local-id=3D"023ee26a37b6" id=3D"USAVBusinessProcessDocumentation-4.7Lis=
tingManagement&amp;ChannelPerformance">4.7 Listing Management &amp; Channel=
 Performance</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"c00fc9ab1c2d">
<li local-id=3D"5ebaf94bac42">
<p local-id=3D"e291591f40b4"><strong>Multi-Account Marketplace Operations</=
strong>: Support connecting and syncing with multiple independent store acc=
ounts on the same marketplace (e.g., separate eBay accounts for retail vs. =
parts sourcing, and multiple Amazon store tags).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2e368ea95e03">
<p local-id=3D"18961aa7c30b"><strong>Listing Health &amp; Violation Monitor=
</strong>:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"6fcfde0b8d80">
<li local-id=3D"ad8d66db6bdb">
<p local-id=3D"7dd9f84220a4">Periodically scan and flag listings with criti=
cal health alerts (e.g., Amazon suppressed buy boxes, search-suppressed ite=
ms, or inactive statuses).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"37b4de0e0c83">
<p local-id=3D"12600ecee19b">Centralize policy violation alerts, copyright/=
IP flags, and warning messages from marketplaces.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"5e523ec9547a">
<p local-id=3D"c5cd677ded76"><strong>Unified Sales Channel Performance Dash=
board</strong>:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"99caa119f426">
<li local-id=3D"527883c3250f">
<p local-id=3D"a58d015e655c">Provide a dashboard comparing total sales volu=
mes, average margins, refund rates, and orders turnaround times across Amaz=
on, eBay, Shopify, Ecwid, and Walmart.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7fe18bf64a17">
<p local-id=3D"167181a77f7e">Break down performance by condition grade (New=
, Grade A, Grade B, Grade C) to determine which marketplaces yield the high=
est returns for specific conditions.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"2d9cc1c838eb">
<h2 local-id=3D"70e2a13f0500" id=3D"USAVBusinessProcessDocumentation-5.Non-=
FunctionalRequirements(NFR)">5. Non-Functional Requirements (NFR)</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"6af9c36bf764" id=3D"USAVBusinessProcessDocumentation-5.1Arc=
hitectureReference">5.1 Architecture Reference</h3>
<p local-id=3D"fedc125035e6">As illustrated by the Frappe Bench and Frappe =
Framework schemas, the system should adopt a modular architecture:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"bbcca4b9b2fc">
<li local-id=3D"f678b80103b6">
<p local-id=3D"c328d539bb70"><strong>Multi-Site/Tenant Capabilities</strong=
>: Ensure data segregation so separate warehouse locations or organizations=
 can run isolated configurations on a single database stack (Multi-tenant s=
ites).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"74396d259a4f">
<p local-id=3D"df5fcc34883d"><strong>Worker Queue Reliability</strong>: Bac=
kground synchronization tasks (fetching eBay orders, updating Shopify stock=
 levels, scanning CCTV frames) must run as background jobs managed by robus=
t Redis queue workers to prevent frontend lag.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a75301d0bf5a">
<p local-id=3D"68be3c9da455"><strong>REST API Gateway</strong>: Provide a s=
tandard API so third-party shipping integrations (UPS, USPS) and local ware=
house scanning computers can read/write data securely.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"95e5aa05d22b" id=3D"USAVBusinessProcessDocumentation-5.2Per=
formance&amp;Reliability">5.2 Performance &amp; Reliability</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"b71988bee62f">
<li local-id=3D"18ba38d4e06c">
<p local-id=3D"47f541e91d91"><strong>Inventory Update Latency</strong>: Cha=
nnel inventory levels must update within $\le 5$ minutes of a unit's status=
 change.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7b4142009985">
<p local-id=3D"0aacabe5857d"><strong>Offline Resilience</strong>: Warehouse=
 scanners must support basic offline capabilities (caching scans in local m=
emory) if the internet drops temporarily.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5ed5a11c2fa5">
<p local-id=3D"6dcd81a603fa"><strong>CCTV Video Integrity</strong>: Video p=
layback links must be stored securely and remain accessible for up to 90 da=
ys after delivery.</p></li>
</ul>
    </div>
</body>
